  "notes": "{養成|ようせい}する functions as a suru-verb meaning \"to train\" or \"to develop.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {人材|じんざい}を{養成|ようせい}する (develop human resources)\n- {養成|ようせい}コース (training course)\n- {養成|ようせい}{講座|こうざ} (training program)\n- {養成|ようせい}{所|じょ}/{養成|ようせい}{機関|きかん} (training institution)\n\nSpecifically refers to training people (not skills or things). Not to be confused with {要請|ようせい} (request/demand), which is a homophone with different kanji and meaning.",
